eleph implements and extends the design of Elephant 2000, a programming
language based on speech acts specified by John McCarthy (Stanford, 6 November
1998) and never implemented by him. The design is his; the implementation,
the completeness thresholds, the commitment obligations and the incremental
runtime are this project's.

